### Phase 53: Fix Production Issues (Complete ✅) 🔧
**Objective:** Resolve remaining production issues.

- [x] **502 Bad Gateway Fix**: Rewrote `start.sh` to start Gunicorn BEFORE Nginx
  - Root cause: App init (~65s) + premature Nginx start = 502
  - Fix: Gunicorn in background → wait port 5055 via `nc -z` → then Nginx
  
- [x] **DATABASE_URL Fix**: Restored env var (was overwritten by GEMINI_API_KEY update)
  - Root cause: `gcloud run services update --set-env-vars` replaces all vars
  - Fix: Set all vars together: `ENVIRONMENT`, `DATABASE_URL`, `GEMINI_API_KEY`

